# One instance of the colour structure in style.md, for sky islands at noon. Never ship it as is:
# every game re-chooses each role for its own tone. Checked against every colour-rule (value = HSV V,
# chroma = S x V, contrast = WCAG ratio): ink value 0.23, chroma 0.10; ink on panel 14.8:1; ink on
# each signal 6.8-12.0:1; ink on each base 3.4-11.0:1; ink on sky-horizon 13.0:1; base value >= 0.76,
# chroma 0.33-0.65 < accent 0.75; accent hue >= 35 deg from every base and sky, >= 45 deg from every
# signal; shadow-tint hue 229, value 0.91, chroma 0.35; key hue 41, chroma 0.15; sky-horizon value
# 1.00, chroma 0.19; sky-top value 0.90; sky chroma max 0.67 < accent 0.75.
